            "note": {
              "A/F22+F29/S1311": [
                "New transactions made by households to the Swedish Tax Agency since the fourth quarter of 2015 (considered as savings) are included here. The Swedish National Debt Office is phasing out the savings form National Debt Savings. "
              ],
              "A/F32/S1311": [
                "Lottery bonds are being phased out as a saving. The last issued lottery bonds will mature in 2021."
              ],
              "A/F519/S2": [
                "According to the National Accounts manual ESA 2010, Swedish households cannot own real assets such as real estate abroad; ownership of real estate abroad is instead registered as a financial asset abroad (ESA 2010 sections 7.76 and 18.15). Swedish households real assets in Sweden are not included in the Savings Barometer, which only shows households financial assets."
              ],
